  "abstract": "Same as prior but sweep U-coherence strength to 5e-6 to test sensitivity. Other settings unchanged (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993,\u03b3_end=0.99; V-ortho \u03bb=1e-5; s_beta L2 \u03bb=1e-4).",
